From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pmos-laurel-sprout <dev@pmos.laurel.invalid>
Date: 2026-08-11
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm6125-xiaomi-laurel-sprout: enable WCN3990 Wi-Fi

Habilita el nodo Wi-Fi WCN3990 por SNOC (ath10k-snoc), NO por SDIO.

El DT Android de referencia (LineageOS android_kernel_xiaomi_sm6125,
commit 713c1f8d, arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/trinket.dtsi) declara:
- icnss@C800000 (reg membase 0xC800000, 8 MiB)
- wlan_msa_mem@53300000 (2 MiB, ya presente en mainline sm6125.dtsi)
- IRQs SPI 358..369 (12 CE)
- vregs L8A (cx-mx), L16A (1.8 XO), L17A (1.3 RFA), L23A (3.3 CH0)

Este nodo replica esa topología con el binding mainline
qcom,wcn3990-wifi y los reguladores PM6125 vreg_l8a/l16a/l17a/l23a
ya definidos en el DTS de placa. El nodo se inserta bajo /soc@0
mediante merge por ruta (soc@0 no expone label en mainline).

Estado: downstream-only (no upstream). El firmware ath10k WCN3990
(sin /lib/firmware/qcom/wcn3990/hw1.0/*) y el board file específico
son requisito runtime; sin ellos el driver carga pero no funciona.

No se tocan mmc@4744000 / mmc@4784000 (el primero está disabled; el
segundo es el lector microSD con no-sdio/no-mmc).

Signed-off-by: pmos-laurel-sprout <dev@pmos.laurel.invalid>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-laurel-sprout.dts | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 28 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-laurel-sprout.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-laurel-sprout.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-laurel-sprout.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6125-xiaomi-laurel-sprout.dts
@@ -484,3 +484,31 @@
 &usb3_dwc3 {
 	extcon = <&extcon_usb>;
 };
+
+/ {
+	soc@0 {
+		wifi@c800000 {
+			compatible = "qcom,wcn3990-wifi";
+			reg = <0x0c800000 0x800000>;
+			reg-names = "membase";
+			memory-region = <&wlan_msa_mem>;
+			interrupts =
+				<GIC_SPI 358 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				<GIC_SPI 359 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				<GIC_SPI 360 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				<GIC_SPI 361 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				<GIC_SPI 362 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				<GIC_SPI 363 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				<GIC_SPI 364 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				<GIC_SPI 365 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				<GIC_SPI 366 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				<GIC_SPI 367 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				<GIC_SPI 368 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				<GIC_SPI 369 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+			vdd-0.8-cx-mx-supply = <&vreg_l8a>;
+			vdd-1.8-xo-supply = <&vreg_l16a>;
+			vdd-1.3-rfa-supply = <&vreg_l17a>;
+			vdd-3.3-ch0-supply = <&vreg_l23a>;
+		};
+	};
+};
